WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
Spring in Quebec.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:05.020
Families and friends head
to «la cabane à sucre».

3
00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.080
On the menu: «la tire
d'érable sur la neige».

4
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.470
Is that a product?

5
00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:12.590
A practice? Or a clue to something deeper,

6
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:16.180
a perspective? In January,
a prompt and a packet

7
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.400
of 6 to 8 sources arrive.

8
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.780
April 30 is the deadline.

9
00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.510
So how do you research a
French-speaking community,

10
00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:26.000
and turn it into notes you can use?

11
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.760
In this mission, you'll
follow the project timeline,

12
00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.420
phase by phase.

13
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.270
Then you'll use the 3Ps
triangle to see what

14
00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.540
sits behind a tradition.

15
00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:38.410
Your mission: find out
how to go from a blank

16
00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:41.400
page to research notes
that are ready to use.
